      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just about playing alone though. it's the feeling that no matter how much i try to write my own rules, the world just keeps pushing me back. i'm just so done with the constant struggle. it feels like i'm just existing for no reason. everything feels so heavy and pointless.",
